            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0721" n="707" xml:id="pg707"/>

                <head><seg type="margin">[697]</seg> *<hi rendition="#italic">Commandant Newton,
                        United States Navy, to Lieutenant-Commandant Farrand, United States
                        Navy.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Handed with sealed orders.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><date calendar="gregorian" when="1849-08-28"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >August</hi> 28, 1849</date>.</dateline>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Proceed to sea at once with the United
                    States schooner Flirt, under your command, and be governed by the accompanying
                        <hi rendition="#italic">sealed orders</hi>, which you are expressly enjoined
                    not to open until after you have crossed the bar and discharged the pilot.</p>
                <p>I am, very respectfully, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>JOHN THOMAS NEWTON<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Commandant.</hi></item>
                            <item>Lieutenant-Commandant <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eben
                                    Farrand.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
